&lt;p&gt;commit 8e4f189eac993ed95b493fa4ce9724346f13e775&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Pavel Tupitsyn &amp;lt;ptupitsyn@gridgain.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
